  m_Name: Evento_AtaqueCiberneticoAosServicosMunicipais
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Metis.Runtime::KnowledgeEntryData
  _title: "Ataque Cibern\xE9tico aos Servi\xE7os Municipais"
  _titleEn: Cyberattack on City Services
  _category: 1
  _unlockTrigger: 0
  _summary: "Num ataque de ransomware, criminosos sequestram os sistemas da prefeitura
    e cobram resgate para devolv\xEA-los."
  _summaryEn: In a ransomware attack, criminals lock up city systems and demand a
    ransom to release them.
  _realWorld: "Em mar\xE7o de 2018, o ransomware SamSam derrubou sistemas da prefeitura
    de Atlanta, nos Estados Unidos; o Departamento de Justi\xE7a acusou dois hackers
    iranianos."
  _realWorldEn: In March 2018, the SamSam ransomware took down city systems in Atlanta,
    in the United States; the Justice Department charged two Iranian hackers.
  _tradeOffs: "C\xF3pias de seguran\xE7a fora da rede, atualiza\xE7\xE3o dos sistemas
    e treinamento da equipe custam menos que a recupera\xE7\xE3o."
  _tradeOffsEn: Offline backups, system updates and staff training cost less than
    recovery.
  _sources:
  - Label: Atlanta government ransomware attack (Wikipedia)
    Url: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Atlanta_government_ransomware_attack
  - Label: US Department of Justice (2018)
    Url: https://www.justice.gov/opa/pr/two-iranian-men-indicted-deploying-ransomware-extort-hospitals-municipalities-and-public
